Commodore 64 emulation uses EmulatorJS (https://emulatorjs.org) with the
VICE x64sc libretro core (https://github.com/EmulatorJS/vice-libretro).
EmulatorJS is GPL-3.0 (see ../emulatorjs/LICENSE). VICE is GPL-2.0 (see
LICENSE.GPL2); retain its upstream attribution and license terms when
redistributing. The core build embeds the required C64 ROMs.
